  DOM["<b>Domain qatlami</b> — biznes obyektlari<br/>Entity’lar: User, Session, Chat, ChatMember, Group, Message, Attachment, Story …<br/>Enum’lar: ChatType, ChatMemberRole, MessageServiceAction"]
